1o7p|n|A large black passerine bird (Corvus corax), similar to the crow, but larger. It is native of the northern parts of Europe, Asia, and America, and is noted for its sagacity. ; Rapine; rapacity. ; Prey; plunder; food obtained by violence.	a:e3m,23,2~e3m,23,2	N:28w2,25,4~28w2,25,4
